	"Description": "Changes to Okta security configuration: policies and policy rules, network zones, applications and app sign-on policies, identity providers, API tokens and administrator role assignments. Usually routed to the IAM team or change review.\n\nNo consumers are attached. Next step after install: add a consumer flow to this alert (email, Slack, Teams, webhook, Jira, ...) to route it where your team works. Alert events are also written to the shared _alerts tag (Contents._vendor is Okta), so you can search them without a consumer. Each producer is a scheduled search; disable a producer to turn off one detection without turning off the alert.",
